invariant: INV-16
file: src/mlkem.c
catches: widemul_runtime_test
reason: the compression of u in ML-KEM encryption runs under
  WIDEMUL_NOT_STATED whatever answer the operation was handed. The
  ciphertext is the same. bin/widemul_runtime_test requires encapsulation
  and decapsulation to call the native copies alone under the
  constant-time answer.

--- old
        widemul_mlk_poly_compress_du(widemul, ct + mlk_poly_comp_du_bytes(rank) * i, &u, rank);
--- new
        widemul_mlk_poly_compress_du(WIDEMUL_NOT_STATED, ct + mlk_poly_comp_du_bytes(rank) * i, &u,
                                     rank);
